\nDescription:\nBuild a self-contained Slack-like team chat at /app. start.sh stays foreground and keeps serving. Three HTTP nodes on 127.0.0.1:8000/8001/8002, IRC on :6667, browser UI at GET /. Local Redis pub/sub on :6379 with fan-out that survives Redis kill. Covers auth, profiles, workspaces, invitations, roles, channels, DMs, messages, threads, reactions, pins, files, search, groups, slash commands, mentions, read state, settings, SPA with pinned testids, WebSocket dense seq, and IRC bridging. No remote services, no Slack SDK, no Docker-in-Docker.\nID:       MARATHON-29\nTitle:    Verify: auth survives Redis-down; ports stay mapped\nStatus:   in_progress\nPriority: 2\nType:     task\nAssignee: qa-engineer-1\nOwner:    marathon-harness\nParent:   MARATHON-1\nLabels:   [qa]\n\nDescription:\nOn integrated head 1235b17 (MARATHON-3 + MARATHON-25), verify against the product specification: with redis-server SIGKILLed, register/login/me still succeed on any of 8000/8001/8002; GET /api/health still returns status ok with node_id 0/1/2 on those ports; cluster remains self-contained with start.sh owning the foreground supervisor and fixed port topology (no remapping).\n{\n  \"id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n  \"title\": \"Huddle: Slack-like team chat cluster\",\n  \"status\": \"open\",\n  \"priority\": 2,\n  \"issue_type\": \"epic\",\n  \"owner\": \"marathon-harness\",\n  \"has_design\": false,\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T19:28:40.099650334Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-08-22T19:28:40.099650334Z\",\n  \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\",\n  \"description\": \"Build a self-contained Slack-like team chat at /app. start.sh stays foreground and keeps serving. Three HTTP nodes on 127.0.0.1:8000/8001/8002, IRC on :6667, browser UI at GET /. Local Redis pub/sub on :6379 with fan-out that survives Redis kill. Covers auth, profiles, workspaces, invitations, roles, channels, DMs, messages, threads, reactions, pins, files, search, groups, slash commands, mentions, read state, settings, SPA with pinned testids, WebSocket dense seq, and IRC bridging. No remote services, no Slack SDK, no Docker-in-Docker.\",\n  \"dependents\": [\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-10\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"DMs: get-or-create pairwise channel\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"issue_type\": \"task\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T19:29:08.808998976Z\",\n      \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-11\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"Files: upload, metadata, download, attach to messages\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"issue_type\": \"task\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T19:29:08.871230869Z\",\n      \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-12\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"Search across accessible channels\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"issue_type\": \"task\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T19:29:16.60312666Z\",\n      \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-13\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"Slash commands: me, shrug, topic, invite, archive\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"issue_type\": \"task\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22T19:29:16.626578687Z\",\n      \"created_by\": \"marathon-harness\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"issue_id\": \"MARATHON-14\",\n      \"depends_on_id\": \"MARATHON-1\",\n      \"type\": \"parent-child\",\n      \"title\": \"Mentions resolution including group channel here\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"issue_type\": \"task\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-22